 "description": "I haven't played this DS Tibanna Gas Miners deck yet. Let me know how to improve it!",
 "strategy": "Basically, the strategy here is to deploy your gas miners to locations that the light side can't (all the sites have zero light side icons). Then, deploy systems, clouds, and cloud cars to make your miners drain away.\n\nI have the weapon-equipped characters in there to protect the gas miners against Nabrun Leids and/or spies.\n\nBiggest weakness I see is low destiny (16 cards with zero) but this deck isn't designed for combat. I did a few sample turns and was able to drain for 8 by round 3.\n\nWhat would improve it?",
